// Trailing spaces are an error, like tabs and bad indentation. Each
// offending line is flagged, spanning the trailing whitespace.

// CHECK: Formatting Error: Line should not end with trailing space
// CHECK: Formatting Error: Line should not end with trailing space
// CHECK: Formatting Error: Line should not end with trailing space
